00:00:45.390 --> 00:00:48.610
We know that Democrats are more likely to
vote absentee, while Republicans are more

00:00:48.610 --> 00:00:49.780
likely to vote in person.

00:00:49.780 --> 00:00:52.830
But Republicans are more likely to live in
rural areas.

00:00:52.830 --> 00:00:56.690
Rural areas are the ones are the areas that
actually need a functioning postal service

00:00:56.690 --> 00:00:57.690
